; The only peer conflict in this tree is electron-vite: its latest stable release (5.0.0)
; declares `vite: ^5.0.0 || ^6.0.0 || ^7.0.0`, while this project builds on Vite 8, which
; vitest, @vitejs/plugin-react and @tailwindcss/postcss all require. Without this line,
; `npm install` aborts with ERESOLVE on a fresh clone. As of 2026-10-13 only
; electron-vite 6.0.0-beta.8 accepts Vite 8, so this stays until electron-vite 6 goes
; stable — verify with `npm view electron-vite peerDependencies` before removing it.
legacy-peer-deps=true
